aping the  titular hotel which was used as a prison  by hor griefs to hold them  i think that this will be reflected in  the world that we will see in season 3  and there will be a greater emphasis put  on the 43 children that were all born on  the same day in 1989.  throughout season 2 there were also  hidden 43 sparrows  and thus we can tell that the creative  team are putting a lot of thought into  this  justin h min who plays ben also stated  that season 3 will be the first time  that the academy have  really had to deal with people that have  supernatural abilities  outside of lila and vonia the group have  never fought a large number of  superhumans  and for season 3 they'll be going  toe-to-toe with other teams that have  these powers  so expected umbrella verse to sparrow  showdown at one point  with ben likely leading the charge now  we still know very little about the 43  beyond lila and the sparrows  and thus i think we will get to see what  happened to the children that weren't  adopted  after we discount all the characters we  know about we're left with 29  superpowered beings on the planet  that the show could definitely explore  so expect some big superhero showdowns  and a lot of cool characters going head  to head but what about lila herself  well it does seem like a certainty that  she will be returning  when discussing the character with  17.com blackman said the following  we're hopeful but i think lila's story  is definitely not finished yet  there's feelings between her and diego  and unfinished business with the family  she got a briefcase and got out but i  would say safely this is not the last we  saw of lila pitts  now it is possible that the time  briefcase could be the key to setting  things straight  but that all depends on whether lila  wants to help out or not  either way i think she was a great  addition to the roster of season 2  and i can't wait to see her back soon as  for the people who probably won't be  returning  i think pretty